  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET MVC Inputs package provides a rich collection of form input controls including TextBox, TextArea, MaskedTextBox, NumericTextBox, ColorPicker, Slider, Uploader, Switch, Signature, Rating, OTP Input, and Speech-To-Text. These controls offer validation, globalization, accessibility (ARIA), RTL support, and customizable styling. They are designed to deliver an enhanced user input experience in forms, data entry screens, and interactive applications built on ASP.NET MVC.",
